<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmanson estimates upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Ahmanson estimates upped.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst Thomas O'Donnell said he increased his 1997 earnings per share estimate for H.F. Ahmanson and Co to $3.25 from $3.20 a share and increased its 1998 operating earnings per share estimate to $4.00 per share from $3.70.</p>
<p>-- O'Donnell cited very strong second quarter operating earnings per share, apart from a one time gain on the sale of Florida branches, or $0.82, versus consensus estimates of $0.77 a share.</p>
